-// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
-/*
- * sun8i-ss-prng.c - hardware cryptographic offloader for
- * Allwinner A80/A83T SoC
- *
- * Copyright (C) 2015-2020 Corentin Labbe <clabbe@baylibre.com>
- *
