+// SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause)
+/*
+ * Copyright 2025 Josua Mayer <josua@solid-run.com>
+ *
+ * Overlay for enabling HummingBoard IIoT MIPI-DSI connector
+ * with Winstar WJ70N3TYJHMNG0 panel.
