Switch to _TIF_SYSCALL_EXIT_WORK for the exit-path re-check to evaluate
only exit-relevant flags (_TIF_SYSCALL_TRACE, _TIF_SYSCALL_AUDIT, and
_TIF_SYSCALL_TRACEPOINT).

